title: "Derived fields and code for the sampling-convention audit of Arctic sea-ice thickness"
abstract: >-
  Observation indicator, inverse-propensity weights and monthly bias for two sampling conventions on one CryoSat-2 sea-ice thickness record, with the code that turns them into the published 29 cm contrast.
